{"id": "sup-012", "prompt": "Customer ko batao ke uske account par ghair-mamooli login ki koshish hui hai aur usay password badalne ki hidayat karo.", "reference": "Aap ke account ki security ke liye ittila di ja rahi hai ke us par ek unusual login attempt hua hai. Baraye meharbani foran apna password change kar lein aur two-factor authentication on kar lein. Kisi madad ki zaroorat ho to hum mojood hain.", "register": "professional, security-conscious", "system": "Reply only in professional Pakistani Roman Urdu; English loanwords are fine.", "tags": ["security", "alert"], "provenance": "native_seed", "status": "candidate"}
{"id": "sup-013", "prompt": "Customer ka debit card gum ho gaya hai; turant block karke naya card issue karne ka process batao.", "reference": "Jee zaroor. Aap ka debit card foran security ke liye hum block kar rahe hain. Kripya apni registered details verify kar dein (CNIC ki last 4 digits aur mother’s name). Block ho jaane ke baad naya card issue kar diya jayega; delivery 5-7 working days me mil jaayegi ya aap branch pickup choose kar sakte hain. PIN kabhi share na karein. Agar aap chahein to temporary card freeze app se bhi kar sakte hain. Kisi bhi unauthorized transaction ke liye humein turant inform karein taa ke dispute raise kiya ja sake.", "register": "empathetic, urgent", "system": "Reply only in professional Pakistani Roman Urdu; English loanwords are fine.", "provenance": "gpt5_generated", "status": "candidate"}
{"id": "sup-014", "prompt": "Customer ko card activate aur PIN set karne ka tareeqa samjhao.", "reference": "Shukriya ji. Card activate karne ke liye aap 1) humari mobile app me Login karein > Cards > Activate Card, ya 2) nearest ATM par card insert karke ‘Card Activation’ select karein. PIN set/Change ke liye ATM ya app dono options available hain. Meherbani karke apna PIN kisi se share na karein aur asaan combinations (1234, date of birth) se parheiz karein. Agar activation me issue aaye to helpline par call karke apni verification ke baad hum madad kar denge.", "register": "concise professional", "system": "Reply only in professional Pakistani Roman Urdu; English loanwords are fine.", "provenance": "gpt5_generated", "status": "candidate"}
{"id": "sup-015", "prompt": "Customer ko mobile app login me OTP receive nahi ho raha; troubleshooting steps aur alternate options batayein.", "reference": "Samajh gaya. Pehle check karein ke aapka network theek chal raha ho aur SIM me SMS/Balance issue na ho. Phone me ‘SMS block’/Do Not Disturb band karein, aur spam folder bhi dekh lein. Agar number recently port hua hai to 24-48 ghante tak OTP delay ho sakta hai. App me registered mobile number confirm karein; agar change hua hai to branch ya helpline par verification ke baad update karwa lein. Urgent access ke liye aap ‘Call me OTP’ (agar available ho) ya helpline se temporary login reset bhi karwa sakte hain.", "register": "reassuring, helpful", "system": "Reply only in professional Pakistani Roman Urdu; English loanwords are fine.", "provenance": "gpt5_generated", "status": "candidate"}
{"id": "sup-016", "prompt": "Customer ki international online payment decline ho rahi hai; enable karne, limits aur FX charges ka guide dein.", "reference": "Jee theek. International/e‑commerce usage ke liye apna card app me ‘Card Controls’ me jaa kar ‘Online’ aur ‘International’ toggle ON karein, aur per‑day/transaction limit set kar lein. Kuch merchants 3D Secure OTP mangte hain—number updated rakhein. Yaad rahe foreign transactions par FX conversion aur markup charges lagte hain, jo statement me show honge. Agar phir bhi decline aaye to card status, expiry, sufficient limit aur merchant country restrictions check kar lein; hum further logs dekh kar assist kar denge.", "register": "informative professional", "system": "Reply only in professional Pakistani Roman Urdu; English loanwords are fine.", "provenance": "gpt5_generated", "status": "candidate"}
{"id": "sup-017", "prompt": "Customer ne ghalti se galat account me funds transfer kar diye; reversal ya recovery ka process samjhao.", "reference": "Afsoos hai ke ghalat transfer ho gaya. Agar ye same‑bank account hai aur beneficiary ne funds use nahi kiye, to hum immediate reversal request raise karte hain. IBFT/1LINK transfer ki surat me receiving bank ko reversal request bheji jati hai; final recovery beneficiary ki consent/par available balance par depend karti hai. Meherbani karke transaction reference, amount, date/time share karein; hum case log karke ticket number provide karenge. Future me payee details save karte waqt IBAN double‑check zaroor karein.", "register": "empathetic, clear", "system": "Reply only in professional Pakistani Roman Urdu; English loanwords are fine.", "provenance": "gpt5_generated", "status": "candidate"}
{"id": "sup-018", "prompt": "Customer self-employed/freelancer hai aur digital account open karna chahta hai; requirements aur steps batayein.", "reference": "Bohat achha. Aap Asaan Digital Account ya Freelancer current/savings open kar sakte hain. App/website par ‘Open Account’ choose karein, CNIC front/back scan, live selfie, basic profile, income nature (freelance/services) aur source of funds enter karein. Foreign inflows ke liye PayPal/Upwork/contract screenshots optional upload kar sakte hain. Video KYC complete karne ke baad account within 24‑48 hours activate ho jata hai. Debit card, cheque book aur IBAN details app me mil jaayengi.", "register": "friendly professional", "system": "Reply only in professional Pakistani Roman Urdu; English loanwords are fine.", "provenance": "gpt5_generated", "status": "candidate"}
{"id": "sup-019", "prompt": "Customer Zakat exemption chah raha hai; CZ-50/Zakat declaration submit karne ka tareeqa aur deadline share karein.", "reference": "Jee bilkul. Zakat exemption ke liye CZ‑50 (Zakat Declaration) form branch me ya app/online portal se submit karein. Ye declaration 1st Ramzan se pehle record me hona chahiye taa ke deduction na ho. Agar aap multiple accounts rakhte hain to har account par declaration lagwana hota hai. Submission ke baad aapko confirmation SMS/email mil jayega. Kisi bhi wajah se deduction ho chuki ho to within timeline reversal request ke liye declaration copy provide kar dein.", "register": "formal, clear", "system": "Reply only in professional Pakistani Roman Urdu; English loanwords are fine.", "provenance": "gpt5_generated", "status": "candidate"}
{"id": "sup-020", "prompt": "Customer ko visa/official use ke liye balance certificate chahiye; fee, TAT aur delivery options batayein.", "reference": "Zaroor. Balance Certificate ke liye app me ‘Services > Certificates’ se request place karein ya branch visit karein. Standard fee as per Schedule of Charges apply hogi. TAT aam tor par 1‑2 working days hai. Aap email PDF, branch pickup ya courier delivery choose kar sakte hain. Agar specific wording ya date range chahiye to request me mention kar dein; hum compliance guidelines ke mutabiq incorporate kar denge.", "register": "concise, professional", "system": "Reply only in professional Pakistani Roman Urdu; English loanwords are fine.", "provenance": "gpt5_generated", "status": "candidate"}
{"id": "sup-021", "prompt": "Overseas Pakistani ne Roshan Digital Account se tax certificate aur repatriation process poocha hai.", "reference": "Shukriya. RDA Tax Certificate aap app/online portal par ‘Statements/Certificates’ se financial year select karke download kar sakte hain. Repatriation ke liye ‘Funds Transfer > Repatriation’ choose karein, apna foreign account IBAN/SWIFT enter karein, source of funds already RDA compliant hone ki wajah se additional tax clearance ki zarurat nahi hoti (as per SBP framework). FX rate execution time par apply hota hai. Koi restriction/paperwork lage to hum email par checklist share kar denge.", "register": "informative, reassuring", "system": "Reply only in professional Pakistani Roman Urdu; English loanwords are fine.", "provenance": "gpt5_generated", "status": "candidate"}
{"id": "sup-022", "prompt": "Customer cheque book reorder aur tracking status pooch raha hai.", "reference": "Theek hai. Cheque book reorder ke liye app me ‘Services > Cheque Book’ se leaves quantity aur delivery mode choose karein. Standard fee/charges SOC ke mutabiq lagte hain. Dispatch ke baad aapko tracking ID SMS/email milta hai; us se courier status check ho jata hai. Urgent requirement ho to branch pickup (express) choose kar sakte hain. Misplacement ki surat me cheque series stop payment ke liye humein foran inform karein.", "register": "neutral, helpful", "system": "Reply only in professional Pakistani Roman Urdu; English loanwords are fine.", "provenance": "gpt5_generated", "status": "candidate"}
{"id": "sup-023", "prompt": "Customer ka kehna hai ATM ne cash dispense nahi kiya lekin account debit ho gaya; dispute raise karne ka tareeqa batayein.", "reference": "Afsoos hai aapko ye issue aaya. Aap transaction time, ATM location, amount aur last 6 digits of card provide karein; hum ‘Cash Not Dispensed’ dispute log kar dete hain. Same‑bank ATM par TAT aam tor par 3‑5 working days hota hai, other‑bank/1LINK par 8‑12 working days lag sakte hain. Investigation complete hote hi reversal credit ho jata hai ya aapko findings share ki jati hain. Is duran duplicate attempts se parheiz karein; koi SMS/OTP kabhi share na karein.", "register": "empathetic, procedural", "system": "Reply only in professional Pakistani Roman Urdu; English loanwords are fine.", "provenance": "gpt5_generated", "status": "candidate"}
{"id": "sup-024", "prompt": "Customer apna account close karna chahta hai; balance settlement, charges aur steps samjhao.", "reference": "Zaroor. Account closure ke liye 1) outstanding charges/hold/loans clear hon, 2) remaining balance aap cash withdrawal, pay order ya IBFT se transfer kara sakte hain. App/portal se closure request (agar enabled) submit karein ya branch me ‘Account Closure Form’ fill karein. Debit card, cheque leaves surrender karna hota hai. Schedule of Charges ke mutabiq closure/PO fees apply ho sakti hain. Request receive hote hi 3‑5 working days me closure process complete kar diya jata hai.", "register": "formal, clear", "system": "Reply only in professional Pakistani Roman Urdu; English loanwords are fine.", "provenance": "gpt5_generated", "status": "candidate"}
{"id": "sup-025", "prompt": "Customer keh raha hai ke nayi SIM activate nahi ho rahi, CNIC verify ho chuka hai lekin network bhi nahi aa raha. Ek professional, meherban reply likhein jisme activation steps aur expected time bataya jaye.", "reference": "Assalam o Alaikum. Aap ki asani ke liye bata dein ke nayi SIM activation normally 30 minute tak lag sakti hai. Meherbani kar ke phone ko ek dafa restart karein, network mode 4G/LTE par confirm karein, aur SIM ko slot 1 mein use karein. Agar biometric verification abhi abhi hui hai to activation thodi der le sakti hai. Agar 30–60 minute mein service active na ho to humein apna CNIC last 6 digits aur location batayein taake hum backend se status check karke turant assist kar saken. Maazrat kisi takleef ke liye—hum yahan help ke liye maujood hain.", "register": "empathetic-professional", "system": "Reply only in professional Pakistani Roman Urdu; English loanwords are fine.", "provenance": "gpt5_generated", "status": "candidate"}
{"id": "sup-026", "prompt": "Customer ne complaint ki hai ke postpaid bill unusually zyada aaya hai aur koi extra data add-on usne nahi liya. Aap aik wazeh aur naram lehje mein verification aur resolution ka process share karein.", "reference": "Aap ki concern bilkul valid hai, maazrat for inconvenience. Hum abhi usage details aur add-ons check kar lete hain. Barah-e-karam apna account number ya registered number verify kar dein. Agar koi unintended add-on lag gaya ho ya billing error ho, hum correction/adjustment process kar denge aur updated bill share karenge. Sath hi aap ke number par usage alerts aur data cap enable karne ki offer karte hain taake future mein aisa issue na ho. Shukriya aap ke sabr ka.", "register": "apologetic-professional", "system": "Reply only in professional Pakistani Roman Urdu; English loanwords are fine.", "provenance": "gpt5_generated", "status": "candidate"}
{"id": "sup-027", "prompt": "Customer keh raha hai ke app se data bundle purchase fail ho gaya lekin balance deduct ho gaya. Aap refund/adjustment aur timeline explain karte hue reply likhein.", "reference": "Maazrat ke saath, lagta hai transaction partially process hui. Aap fikar na karein, hum is amount ko ya to same bundle mein activate karwa denge ya 24–48 working hours mein wallet/balance mein reverse kar denge. Kripya transaction time, app screenshot (agar possible ho) aur registered number share kar dein. Is darmiyan aap ko urgent data chahiye to hum temporary courtesy MBs bhi allocate kar sakte hain.", "register": "apologetic-proactive", "system": "Reply only in professional Pakistani Roman Urdu; English loanwords are fine.", "provenance": "gpt5_generated", "status": "candidate"}
{"id": "sup-028", "prompt": "Customer agle hafte UAE travel kar raha hai, international roaming ON karwana hai aur basic rates/roaming bundle info chahiye. Aap concise aur helpful reply dein.", "reference": "Zaroor. International Roaming UAE ke liye activate karne ke liye postpaid par credit limit required hoti hai, prepaid par IR eligibility check karni hoti hai. Aap Settings > Roaming ON rakhain. Hum aap ko recommend karte hain ke UAE Roaming Bundle subscribe kar lein taake per MB/call rate kam ho. Bundles: Daily/Weekly options available hotay hain; subscription USSD/App/helpline se ho sakti hai. Roaming activation 2–4 hours tak lag sakti hai, departure se pehle ON karwa lein. Agar chahen to hum abhi request place kar dein?", "register": "formal-helpful", "system": "Reply only in professional Pakistani Roman Urdu; English loanwords are fine.", "provenance": "gpt5_generated", "status": "candidate"}
{"id": "sup-029", "prompt": "Customer report kar raha hai ke un ke area mein signals nahi aa rahe (specific location di hui hai). Aap outage check, ETA, aur workaround (Wi‑Fi calling etc.) ke sath jawab dein.", "reference": "Shukriya location share karne ka. Hum ne aap ke area ka network status check kiya hai; yahan temporary maintenance/utility outage chal rahi hai jis ki wajah se coverage impact hai. Our team field par hai, estimated restoration 4–6 hours hai. Is dauran, agar possible ho to Wi‑Fi Calling enable kar lein, ya 2G/3G/4G toggle karke best available network select karen. Takleef ke liye maazrat—hum progress monitor kar rahe hain aur normal service jaldi resume ho gi.", "register": "reassuring-professional", "system": "Reply only in professional Pakistani Roman Urdu; English loanwords are fine.", "provenance": "gpt5_generated", "status": "candidate"}
{"id": "sup-030", "prompt": "Customer ne MNP port-in request di thi, 4 din hogaye status pending hai. Aap delay reasons, required actions, aur expected timeline batayein.", "reference": "Maazrat delay ke liye. Port-in usually 72 hours mein complete ho jata hai, lekin kabhi kabhi donor network ki clearance ya CNIC/biometric mismatch ki wajah se hold par chala jata hai. Meherbani karke CNIC validity, outstanding dues (agar koi) aur active SIM status confirm kar dein. Hum backend team se expedite request raise kar rahe hain. Expected completion next 24–48 hours hai. Jaisa hi done hoga, aap ko SMS confirmation mil jayega.", "register": "formal-concise", "system": "Reply only in professional Pakistani Roman Urdu; English loanwords are fine.", "provenance": "gpt5_generated", "status": "candidate"}
{"id": "sup-031", "prompt": "Customer kehta hai eSIM QR code iPhone par scan nahi ho raha. Aap step-by-step troubleshooting aur alternate issuance ka process share karein.", "reference": "Zaroor guide karte hain: (1) iPhone Settings > Cellular > Add eSIM par jayen. (2) Stable internet/Wi‑Fi confirm karein. (3) QR ko bright light mein scan karein; agar activation code expired hai to scan fail hota hai. (4) Device iOS updated ho. Agar phir bhi issue rahe to hum aap ko fresh eSIM profile re-issue kar dete hain (security verification ke baad). Previous eSIM ko remove karke naya QR use karna hoga. Bata dein kya re-issue proceed karein?", "register": "helpful-technical", "system": "Reply only in professional Pakistani Roman Urdu; English loanwords are fine.", "provenance": "gpt5_generated", "status": "candidate"}
{"id": "sup-032", "prompt": "Customer ki SIM kho gai hai, turant block karwana aur duplicate SIM ka process pooch raha hai. Aap urgent tone mein secure steps batayein.", "reference": "Aap ki safety ke liye hum abhi immediate temporary block laga dete hain. Kripya registered CNIC last 6 digits verify kar dein. Duplicate SIM ke liye nearest franchise/CSC par apna original CNIC le kar jayen; biometric ke baad same number par replacement issue ho jayega. Service fee nominal hoti hai. Agar mobile device bhi lost hai to PTA Device Blocking ke liye imei blacklist request bhi file kar dein. Hum guide kar dete hain.", "register": "urgent-empathetic", "system": "Reply only in professional Pakistani Roman Urdu; English loanwords are fine.", "provenance": "gpt5_generated", "status": "candidate"}
{"id": "sup-033", "prompt": "Customer caller tunes/vas service band karna chahta hai aur keh raha hai ke bina kehye charges lag rahe hain. Refund policy aur unsubscribe steps batayein.", "reference": "Maazrat for inconvenience. Hum abhi aap ke number se caller tunes/VAS ko deactivate kar dete hain. Normally charges daily/weekly deduct hotay hain; deactivate ke baad further deduction nahi hoga. Agar recent unintended activation hua ho to hum last cycle ka goodwill reversal evaluate kar sakte hain. Aap ko confirmation SMS mil jayega. Future mein protection ke liye content bar/DND enable kar dein—agar aap chahen to hum abhi activate kar dete hain.", "register": "apologetic-reassuring", "system": "Reply only in professional Pakistani Roman Urdu; English loanwords are fine.", "provenance": "gpt5_generated", "status": "candidate"}
{"id": "sup-034", "prompt": "Home fiber broadband customer slow speed aur high latency report kar raha hai. Basic troubleshooting, line test, aur technician visit scheduling ka reply likhein.", "reference": "Afsos hai speed issue par. Pehle quick checks: ONT/router restart karein (power off 30 sec), LAN cable secure, 5GHz Wi‑Fi prefer karein, background downloads pause kar dein. Hum abhi line test run kar rahe hain; agar SNR/latency out of range hui to field visit arrange karenge. Meherbani karke preferred time slot share kar dein (morning/afternoon). Ticket raise kar diya jayega aur technician 24–48 hours mein coordinate karega.", "register": "technical-professional", "system": "Reply only in professional Pakistani Roman Urdu; English loanwords are fine.", "provenance": "gpt5_generated", "status": "candidate"}
{"id": "sup-035", "prompt": "Corporate account admin naya number add karwana chahta hai aur billing email update karna hai. Aap process, required docs, aur TAT batayein.", "reference": "Zaroor. Corporate account mein number add karne ke liye authorized letter ya portal request required hoti hai. Hum ko company NTN, CP/LOA aur contact person details chahiye hoti hain. Billing email update ke liye official domain se confirmation email enough hai. SLA: profile update 4–8 working hours, new line provisioning 1–2 business days (stock/verification dependent). Agar aap approve karein to hum request form share kar dein?", "register": "formal-business", "system": "Reply only in professional Pakistani Roman Urdu; English loanwords are fine.", "provenance": "gpt5_generated", "status": "candidate"}
{"id": "sup-036", "prompt": "Customer spam calls/SMS se tang hai, DND aur spam report karnay ka tariqa pooch raha hai. Aap simple steps aur caveats batayein.", "reference": "Aap ki privacy hamare liye important hai. DND/marketing opt-out enable karne ke liye hum abhi request place kar dete hain; activation 24 hours mein ho jata hai. Spam SMS/calls report karne ke liye sender number aur message ko forward karein ya app mein Report Spam option use karein. Unknown links par click na karein aur OTP kisi se share na karein. Agar koi specific number repeatedly disturb kar raha hai to temporary number block feature bhi app/phone settings mein available hai. Hum hamesha support ke liye yahan hain.", "register": "friendly-warm", "system": "Reply only in professional Pakistani Roman Urdu; English loanwords are fine.", "provenance": "gpt5_generated", "status": "candidate"}
{"id": "sup-037", "prompt": "Customer keh raha hai uska order 5 din se late hai. Tracking me 'in transit' aa raha hai. Is customer ko update aur reassurance dene wala reply likho.", "reference": "Assalam o Alaikum, aapka order delay hone par hamein afsos hai. Tracking ke mutabiq parcel abhi transit me hai aur hamari courier team se follow-up chal raha hai. Aksar aise cases 1-2 working days me deliver ho jate hain. Meherbani karke kal tak ka waqt dijiye; agar deliver na ho to hum escalated follow-up karenge ya alternate solution (refund/replace) offer karenge. Aapka tracking ID yeh hai: ABC123. Hum yahan maujood hain, koi bhi sawaal ho to zaroor batayein.", "register": "Apologetic, reassuring", "system": "Reply only in professional Pakistani Roman Urdu; English loanwords are fine.", "provenance": "gpt5_generated", "status": "candidate"}
{"id": "sup-038", "prompt": "Customer ko galat color ka product mila hai. Replacement process samjha kar reply likho.", "reference": "Humein maazrat hai ke aapko galat color receive hua. Aapki asaani ke liye hum free replacement arrange kar rahe hain. Bara-e-karam packaging aur product ki 2-3 tasveerain is chat me share kar dein. Jaisay hi verify hota hai, hum 24-48 hours me pickup book kar denge aur correct color dispatch karenge. Aapko koi extra charges nahi lagenge. Agar aap refund prefer karte hain to bhi bata dijiye, hum turant initiate kar denge.", "register": "Professional, solution-focused", "system": "Reply only in professional Pakistani Roman Urdu; English loanwords are fine.", "provenance": "gpt5_generated", "status": "candidate"}
{"id": "sup-039", "prompt": "Customer return window miss kar gaya hai 2 din se. Policy explain karte hue ek flexible solution offer karna hai.", "reference": "Afsos ke sath batana pad raha hai ke hamari return window 14 days ki hoti hai jo 2 din pehle close ho chuki hai. Phir bhi hum aapki madad karna chahte hain: agar product unused aur tags intact hain to hum exception review raise kar sakte hain. Bara-e-karam order number aur product ki tasveerain share karein; approval milte hi pickup arrange kar denge. Agar yeh possible na hua to hum aapko partial store credit offer kar denge taake aap future purchase me istemal kar saken.", "register": "Empathetic, policy-aware", "system": "Reply only in professional Pakistani Roman Urdu; English loanwords are fine.", "provenance": "gpt5_generated", "status": "candidate"}
{"id": "sup-040", "prompt": "Customer kehta hai payment card se deduct ho gayi lekin order place nahi hua. Investigation aur timeline ke sath reply likho.", "reference": "Samajh sakte hain yeh situation pareshan kun hoti hai. Hamari side se is waqt koi confirmed order generate nahi hua. Aksar bank ke end par pending authorizations 24-48 working hours me auto-reverse ho jati hain. Humne aapka case log kar diya hai (Ref: PAY-5678). Agar amount 48 hours me wapas na aaye to aap apne bank ka reversal slip share kar dein, hum finance team se priority verification karwa ke resolve kar denge. Aap chahen to Cash on Delivery par bhi order place kar sakte hain.", "register": "Calm, informative", "system": "Reply only in professional Pakistani Roman Urdu; English loanwords are fine.", "provenance": "gpt5_generated", "status": "candidate"}
{"id": "sup-041", "prompt": "Customer damaged item receive karne per complaint kar raha hai. Claim process aur timeline batate hue response likho.", "reference": "Humein nihayat afsos hai ke aapko damaged item mila. Quality team ko claim file karne ke liye hamein 3 cheezein chahiye: (1) outer box ki tasveer, (2) product ke damage ki clear images/video, (3) order number. Jaisay hi yeh milta hai, hum 24 hours me claim approve karke replacement ya full refund process kar denge. Pickup courier hamari taraf se arrange hoga, aapko koi extra cost nahi padegi.", "register": "Apologetic, process-oriented", "system": "Reply only in professional Pakistani Roman Urdu; English loanwords are fine.", "provenance": "gpt5_generated", "status": "candidate"}
{"id": "sup-042", "prompt": "Customer size exchange chahta hai apparel ka. Stock check, exchange policy aur steps batate hue reply likho.", "reference": "Bilkul, size exchange me hum madad karenge. Hamari policy ke mutabiq unworn item with tags 14 days me exchange ho jata hai. Maine aapka desired size (M) check kiya, yeh is waqt available hai. Bara-e-karam packaging safe rakhein; hum pickup create kar dete hain. Jaisay hi warehouse me item inspect ho jayega, 2-3 working days me correct size dispatch kar diya jayega. Agar size OOS ho gaya to aapko full refund ya store credit offer kiya jayega—jo aap prefer karein.", "register": "Helpful, courteous", "system": "Reply only in professional Pakistani Roman Urdu; English loanwords are fine.", "provenance": "gpt5_generated", "status": "candidate"}
{"id": "sup-043", "prompt": "Customer coupon code apply nahi ho raha. Eligibility rules aur alternate discount suggest karte hue jawab likho.", "reference": "Lagta hai coupon apply nahi ho raha kyun ke yeh sale items par valid nahi hai aur minimum cart value Rs. 2,000 required hai. Aapka current cart Rs. 1,650 hai is liye validation fail ho rahi hai. Aap chahen to koi non-sale item add karke threshold complete kar lein, ya phir hum aapko 5% alternate discount code de sakte hain jo store-wide applicable hai: SAVE5 (aaj raat 12 bajay tak valid). Batayein kaunsa option theek rahega.", "register": "Concise, proactive", "system": "Reply only in professional Pakistani Roman Urdu; English loanwords are fine.", "provenance": "gpt5_generated", "status": "candidate"}
{"id": "sup-044", "prompt": "Customer order place karne ke baad delivery address change karwana chahta hai. Cutoff aur confirmation ke sath reply likho.", "reference": "Zaroor, agar order abhi pack/shipped nahi hua to address update ho sakta hai. Aap ka order #12345 filhaal processing me hai, is liye hum address change request submit kar rahe hain. Naya complete address aur contact number confirm kar dein. Agar parcel already dispatch ho gaya to hum courier reroute try karenge, lekin is me 1-2 din extra lag sakte hain.", "register": "Efficient, procedural", "system": "Reply only in professional Pakistani Roman Urdu; English loanwords are fine.", "provenance": "gpt5_generated", "status": "candidate"}
{"id": "sup-045", "prompt": "Customer ko account login issue aa raha hai (OTP nahi aa raha). Troubleshooting steps aur alternate access batate hue reply likho.", "reference": "OTP receive na hone ki wajah network delay ya blocked SMS ho sakta hai. Bara-e-karam phone me spam/blocked messages check karein, network toggle karein, aur 5 minutes baad dobara OTP request karein. Agar phir bhi na aaye to hum email-based login enable kar sakte hain ya manual verification ke zariye temporary access de sakte hain. Apna registered email share kar dein, hum turant assist karte hain.", "register": "Supportive, clear", "system": "Reply only in professional Pakistani Roman Urdu; English loanwords are fine.", "provenance": "gpt5_generated", "status": "candidate"}
{"id": "sup-046", "prompt": "Customer Cash on Delivery par partial payment ya open-box check maang raha hai. Policy clarify karte hue respectful reply likho.", "reference": "Hamari COD policy ke mutabiq delivery par full payment required hoti hai aur open-box check courier partner allow nahi karta. Haan, aap parcel receive karne ke baad 14 days no-questions-asked return ka option avail kar sakte hain. Agar aapko pre-delivery inspection zaroori hai to prepaid orders par hum warehouse QC video share kar sakte hain. Aap jis option ko prefer karein hum arrange kar denge.", "register": "Respectful, policy-clarifying", "system": "Reply only in professional Pakistani Roman Urdu; English loanwords are fine.", "provenance": "gpt5_generated", "status": "candidate"}
{"id": "sup-047", "prompt": "Customer bol raha hai ke refund expected timeline cross ho gaya. Escalation aur exact next steps ke sath reply likho.", "reference": "Maazrat chahtay hain ke aapka refund promised timeline se late ho gaya. Maine aapka case finance team ko escalate kar diya hai (Ticket: REF-9021). Bank refunds normally 5-7 working days lete hain; aaj ham priority push de rahe hain. Aapko 24 hours me email par updated ARN/transaction proof share kar diya jayega. Agar kal tak update na aaye to main personally follow-up karke same day resolution dilaunga.", "register": "Accountable, reassuring", "system": "Reply only in professional Pakistani Roman Urdu; English loanwords are fine.", "provenance": "gpt5_generated", "status": "candidate"}
{"id": "sup-048", "prompt": "Customer pooch raha hai ke product warranty claim kaise file karein (electronics). Step-by-step guide likho.", "reference": "Warranty claim ke liye simple steps: (1) Order invoice ki copy aur product serial number note karein, (2) issue ki short video/photographs banayein, (3) is chat me share karein ya support@ourstore.pk par mail kar dein subject 'Warranty Claim + Order#'. Hum brand service center me claim log kar ke pickup/assessment arrange kar denge. Processing 7-10 working days lag sakti hai. Agar part unavailable hua to hum replacement ya store credit offer karenge—jo aap behtareen samjhein.", "register": "Instructional, polite", "system": "Reply only in professional Pakistani Roman Urdu; English loanwords are fine.", "provenance": "gpt5_generated", "status": "candidate"}
{"id": "sup-049", "prompt": "Customer keh raha hai driver 15 minute se map par atka hua hai aur move nahi kar raha, woh jaldi mein hai. Isko help karte hue reply likhein.", "reference": "Assalam o Alaikum! Humein afsos hai ke driver abhi move nahi kar raha. Mein abhi trip status check kar raha hoon. Agar driver 2-3 minutes mein progress na kare to mein aapki ride free reassign karwa deta hoon ya nearest available captain bhejta hoon. Aap chahein to bina fee cancel bhi kar sakte hain kyun ke delay captain ki side se hai. Kya aap reassign chahte hain ya cancel prefer karenge?", "register": "empathetic-professional", "system": "Reply only in professional Pakistani Roman Urdu; English loanwords are fine.", "provenance": "gpt5_generated", "status": "candidate"}
{"id": "sup-050", "prompt": "User ko cancellation fee lag gayi jab captain location par aaya hi nahi. Fee reversal ka friendly jawab dein.", "reference": "Maazrat chahte hain aapko cancellation fee lagi jab ke captain time par nahi pohancha. Mein ne trip logs review kiye hain; captain ki no-show lag rahi hai. Aapki cancellation fee Rs 0 kar di gayi hai aur refund 24-48 ghanton mein card/account par reflect ho jayega. Aap ka feedback note kar liya hai taake aisi delay repeat na ho.", "register": "apologetic-warm", "system": "Reply only in professional Pakistani Roman Urdu; English loanwords are fine.", "provenance": "gpt5_generated", "status": "candidate"}
{"id": "sup-051", "prompt": "Customer keh raha hai credit card se double charge ho gaya. Investigation aur resolution ka structured reply likhein.", "reference": "Shukriya for reaching out. Double charge ka concern samajh sakte hain. System ke mutabiq pehla amount pre-auth hold hai aur second actual fare charge hua. Hold 3-5 business days mein bank release kar deta hai. Agar dono amounts post ho gaye hon to please last 4 digits aur transaction time share kar dein; hum dispute raise karke duplicate charge ko reverse karwa denge. Afsos hai apko asaani na mili.", "register": "professional-reassuring", "system": "Reply only in professional Pakistani Roman Urdu; English loanwords are fine.", "provenance": "gpt5_generated", "status": "candidate"}
{"id": "sup-052", "prompt": "Promo code apply nahi ho raha jab ke user kehta hai terms meet ho rahi hain. Clear guidance aur alternate offer ka jawab dein.", "reference": "Samajh sakta hoon ke promo apply na hona frustrating hota hai. Is code ki eligibility city, ride type aur expiry par depend karti hai. Lagta hai ke yeh code sirf Go rides par valid hai aur aaj midnight tak. Aap agle booking screen par ride type Go select karen, phir code re-enter karen. Agar phir bhi issue aye to mein aapko courtesy discount voucher Rs 150 send kar deta hoon jo 7 din valid hoga.", "register": "helpful-friendly", "system": "Reply only in professional Pakistani Roman Urdu; English loanwords are fine.", "provenance": "gpt5_generated", "status": "candidate"}
